{
  "uid": "juniper-cascor",
  "title": "JuniperCascor",
  "description": "CasCor training service metrics",
  "tags": ["juniper", "juniper-cascor"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "interval",
        "type": "interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,10m,30m,1h",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "5m", "value": "5m" },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RED Overview",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request Rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total[$interval]))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error Rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 Latency",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HTTP Metrics",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate by Endpoint",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (method, endpoint) (rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total[$interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{endpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Request Duration Heatmap",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(juniper_cascor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le)",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": { "unit": "s" },
        "color": { "scheme": "Oranges" },
        "tooltip": { "show": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Training Metrics",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Training Sessions",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_training_sessions_active",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Hidden Units",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_hidden_units_total",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "purple", "value": null }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Epochs Completed",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (phase) (rate(juniper_cascor_training_epochs_total[$interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Training Loss",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_training_loss",
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}} — {{loss_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "axisLabel": "Loss"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Training Accuracy",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_training_accuracy_ratio",
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "axisLabel": "Accuracy"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Candidate Training",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Candidate Correlation",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_candidate_correlation",
          "legendFormat": "Best Candidate Correlation"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": -1,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "axisLabel": "Correlation"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.3 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.7 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Inference",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inference Request Rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(juniper_cascor_inference_requests_total[$interval])",
          "legendFormat": "Inference Requests"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inference Latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 37 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_inference_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_inference_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_inference_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "fillOpacity": 5 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Build Info",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 45 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Service Version",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 46 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_build_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{version}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "" } } }]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Python Version",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 46 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_build_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{python_version}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "" } } }]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pending R4.4 — worker heartbeat Prometheus bridge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49 },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Worker last_task_duration_seconds (JSON-only — Prometheus bridge pending)",
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "**Status:** the heartbeat field **is delivered** by juniper-cascor on the JSON `/v1/workers` endpoint, but it has **not** been bridged to Prometheus, so no `/metrics` series exists yet.\n\n**Verified on `origin/main` of juniper-cascor:**\n- Field defined: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/registry.py:60-62` (`WorkerRegistration.last_task_duration_seconds: float | None`).\n- Exposed via JSON: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/routes.py:55-57` (`GET /v1/workers`).\n- **Missing:** no `Gauge(...)` instantiation anywhere under `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/`.\n\n**Planned PromQL** (after the bridge ships):\n```\njuniper_cascor_worker_last_task_duration_seconds{worker_id}\n```\n\n**Bridge entry point (suggested):** add a new `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/metrics.py` module (or append to the existing observability module) that instantiates a `Gauge` per heartbeat field and updates from `WorkerRegistry.snapshot()` on each Prometheus scrape (collector callback) or on each heartbeat ingest.\n\n**Tracking:** new sub-track candidate (`R5.x` or Phase-6 follow-up): \"Worker heartbeat → Prometheus bridge\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Worker gpu_utilization_pct (JSON-only — Prometheus bridge pending)",
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 50 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "**Status:** the heartbeat field **is delivered** by juniper-cascor on the JSON `/v1/workers` endpoint, but it has **not** been bridged to Prometheus, so no `/metrics` series exists yet.\n\n**Verified on `origin/main` of juniper-cascor:**\n- Field defined: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/registry.py:60-62` (`WorkerRegistration.gpu_utilization_pct: float | None`).\n- Exposed via JSON: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/routes.py:55-57` (`GET /v1/workers`).\n- **Missing:** no `Gauge(...)` instantiation anywhere under `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/`.\n\n**Planned PromQL** (after the bridge ships):\n```\njuniper_cascor_worker_gpu_utilization_pct{worker_id}\n```\n\n**Bridge entry point:** same module as the `last_task_duration_seconds` bridge above. Range 0–100; emit `NaN` (or skip the sample) when the field is `None` (no GPU detected).\n\n**Tracking:** same sub-track as the `last_task_duration_seconds` row."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Worker recent_task_durations_seconds (JSON-only — Prometheus bridge pending)",
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 50 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "**Status:** `recent_task_durations_seconds` is a per-worker **list field** on the heartbeat (`juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/registry.py:60-62`), exposed only as JSON via `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/routes.py:55-57`. Not currently scraped.\n\n**Planned representation** (decide during bridge implementation):\n- **(a)** Bridge each list value into a `Histogram` (`juniper_cascor_worker_task_duration_seconds{worker_id}`) — preferred; gives us SLO-friendly bucket math.\n- **(b)** Emit per-worker p50/p95/p99 `Gauge` quantiles computed in-process at scrape time.\n\n**Bridge entry point:** same Prometheus bridge module proposed for the other two heartbeat fields. Choice between (a) and (b) likely driven by R5.1 SLO design.\n\n**Tracking:** new sub-track candidate (`R5.x` or Phase-6 follow-up): \"Worker heartbeat → Prometheus bridge\"."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3
}
